  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now compare the three methods.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1880,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 56,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Method 1 keeps a complete copy of the matrix.",
      "start_ms": 2420,
      "end_ms": 5540,
      "start_frame": 73,
      "end_frame": 166,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "That needs O M times N extra space.",
      "start_ms": 6120,
      "end_ms": 9680,
      "start_frame": 184,
      "end_frame": 290,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "For the exact version we wrote, suppose there are z original zeros.",
      "start_ms": 10080,
      "end_ms": 14920,
      "start_frame": 302,
      "end_frame": 448,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "We scan the matrix once.",
      "start_ms": 15340,
      "end_ms": 16980,
      "start_frame": 460,
      "end_frame": 509,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "And for each of those z zeros, we may walk through one complete row and one complete column.",
      "start_ms": 17560,
      "end_ms": 23600,
      "start_frame": 527,
      "end_frame": 708,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "So the time is O of M times N plus z times open bracket M plus N close bracket.",
      "start_ms": 24100,
      "end_ms": 32280,
      "start_frame": 723,
      "end_frame": 968,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "And in the worst case, z itself can be M times N.",
      "start_ms": 32680,
      "end_ms": 36200,
      "start_frame": 980,
      "end_frame": 1086,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "So the worst case time becomes O of M times N times open bracket M plus N close bracket.",
      "start_ms": 36820,
      "end_ms": 42900,
      "start_frame": 1105,
      "end_frame": 1287,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Method 2 is much better.",
      "start_ms": 43860,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "start_frame": 1316,
      "end_frame": 1358,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "We scan the matrix to build row and column markers, then scan it again to apply them.",
      "start_ms": 45260,
      "end_ms": 51440,
      "start_frame": 1358,
      "end_frame": 1543,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us O M times N time and O M plus N extra space.",
      "start_ms": 52040,
      "end_ms": 57700,
      "start_frame": 1561,
      "end_frame": 1731,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimal method keeps the same asymptotic time.",
      "start_ms": 58400,
      "end_ms": 61600,
      "start_frame": 1752,
      "end_frame": 1848,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We scan the first row, the first column, the interior for marker discovery, the interior again to apply those markers and finally the boundaries.",
      "start_ms": 62120,
      "end_ms": 73180,
      "start_frame": 1864,
      "end_frame": 2195,
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "These are sequential passes.",
      "start_ms": 74060,
      "end_ms": 75720,
      "start_frame": 2222,
      "end_frame": 2272,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The dominant work is still proportional to the number of cells.",
      "start_ms": 76460,
      "end_ms": 80520,
      "start_frame": 2294,
      "end_frame": 2416,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "So the time is O M times N.",
      "start_ms": 81320,
      "end_ms": 84860,
      "start_frame": 2440,
      "end_frame": 2546,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "And apart from loop indices, we only keep two Booleans.",
      "start_ms": 85860,
      "end_ms": 90120,
      "start_frame": 2576,
      "end_frame": 2704,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So the extra space is O one.",
      "start_ms": 90800,
      "end_ms": 94240,
      "start_frame": 2724,
      "end_frame": 2827,
      "word_count": 7
    }
  ],
